@baseUrl = http://localhost:5009

### Start impersonating a target user (SuperAdmin only)
# Cookie-session swap: the current session cookie is re-issued as the target identity with
# provenance claims. No token is returned; the response is the /api/me-shaped payload.
# Replace the {edjeId} path segment with a valid target GUID.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/impersonate/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000042

### Start impersonating - non-existent target (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/impersonate/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999

### Stop impersonating (restores the original identity from provenance claims)
# Callable by the impersonated session itself; requires only an authenticated cookie.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/impersonate/stop

### Session probe (reflects the impersonated identity + impersonator block while impersonating)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
